{% comment %}
  Main E.212 MNC table from a lutaml_data `edition` (Ituob::Models::RegisterEdition,
  provider:ituob.edition). Replaces the `data`/`metadata` section of _tables.liquid
  for documents migrated off yaml2text (spd#89 C8, English only).

  Labels are English literals until locale(register:) (spd#102) is on main.

  The country cell spans a RUN of consecutive items with the same country. The
  old section counted every item of that country in the whole list, which is only
  right while the data is sorted by country; provider items keep replay order, so
  a run is the correct span. Items with no country (data gap) get a blank country
  cell and are not merged into the previous country.
{% endcomment %}
== Mobile Network Codes (MNC) for the international identification plan for public networks and subscriptions (According to Recommendation ITU-T E.212 (09/2016))

[cols="25%,55%,20%",options="header,unnumbered"]
|===
| Country or Geographical Area
| Networks
^| MCC + MNC codes

{% assign items = edition.items %}
{% assign previous = "-" %}
{% for item in items %}
    {% assign current = item.country_or_area.en | default: "" %}
    {% if forloop.first or current != previous %}
        {% assign previous = current %}
        {% assign span = 1 %}
        {% assign start = forloop.index %}
        {% for next_item in items offset: start %}
            {% assign next_country = next_item.country_or_area.en | default: "" %}
            {% if next_country != current %}{% break %}{% endif %}
            {% assign span = span | plus: 1 %}
        {% endfor %}
        .{{ span | plus: 1 }}+| {{ current }} | |
    {% endif %}
    | {{ item.networks | replace: "|", "\|" }}
    ^| {{ item.mcc_mnc_codes }}

{% endfor %}
|===
